Subject: Cantor EVO-X2 Scratch Build Executor P0 Exploded Meaning

@ [exploded_uuid] f32ccb83-2b71-472c-80c0-3178ada2a646
@ [canonical_uuid] 935e020f-8c6f-49e4-b355-63eabd3b778b

& [SemanticAtoms]
  + [proposal] is the published inert plan and contains no permission to execute
  + [commission] is exact one-run authority bounded by identities grants denials roots operations environment and resources
  + [admission] proves current preconditions before one operation may begin
  + [operation_record] proves one admitted attempt and its bounded outcome but not later success
  + [receipt] binds the complete stopped or successful state and conservation account
  + [publication] makes retained evidence reviewable and never adds repeat authority

& [IdentityFlow]
  + source bookend -> formation -> implementation bookend -> package plus archive plus plan -> signed commission -> seven records -> receipt -> independent replay -> publication

& [AuthorityFlow]
  + formation publication authorizes effectless local implementation
  + implementation publication authorizes remote preflight and one exact commissioned run
  + each operation requires the preceding admitted record and failure removes every later admission
  + success authorizes neither cleanup repetition artifact deployment nor autonomous follow-on

& [FailureFlow]
  + refusal occurs before an operation when an input or precondition fails
  + failure records an admitted operation that times out overflows or exits unsuccessfully
  + both states retain completed evidence and safe scratch state for later governed decision

& [NonEquivalence]
  + planned is not commissioned commissioned is not executed attempted is not passed built is not deployed retained is not persistent service and measured is not autonomous productivity
